Z||000003||Silver88GT||12-04-2001||11:51 PM||||I've been having a similar problem.  The hesitation is about one second (with a light pop-pop-pop from the exhaust) then she runs great.<P>Replaced TPS, TB, IAC (with used one), O2 Sensor, fuel filter, plugs, EGR vacuum hose.  Ran injector cleaner through a few times.  A little better, but still pretty bad.<P>I have a 2.8 with only 70,000 mi.  Replacing the coil, wires, and put in better plugs are on my list for this winter and get it tuned up.  Might this help?<P>I also have an extra set of injectors.  How can I tell if the ones in there might be bad or do I have to pay someone to figure it out?  Maybe a good professional injector cleaning is in order?<P>Any ideas would be a great help.  Thanks.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Silver88GT (Wingless)||||reg||5
